ns and availability are confirmed on enquiry.'],['clearer-quotation-requests','A clearer enquiry makes a better starting point.','What to include when you send a quotation request for construction or finishing materials.','Procurement','Make the request easy to understand\nOrganise your list by material category and describe each item clearly. Include dimensions, quantities, units and any approved product requirements.\n\nSeparate confirmed details from questions\nFlag uncertain items rather than guessing. This helps the conversation focus on the information that needs to be checked before a quotation can be confirmed.\n\nShare your timing\nInclude your required date and project location. Availability and any fulfilment arrangements must be discussed and confirmed by the team.\n\nKeep the conversation open\nYou can submit a material list or PDF BOQ through the quotation form. Final pricing and availability are determined by the team.']];
